<pre>Li T, Fan K, Wang J, Wang W. Reduction of protein sequence
complexity by residue grouping. Protein Eng 2003; 5:323-330.
<a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/query.fcgi?cmd=Retrieve&amp;db=PubMed&amp;list_uids=12826723&amp;dopt=Abstract" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PubMed</a></pre>

